<title>USA: First Western Bancorp Q3 net drops.</title>
<headline>First Western Bancorp Q3 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CASTLE, Pa. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   Sep 30, Sep 30,    Sep 30, Sep 30,</p>
<p>					  1996     1995    1996    1995</p>
<p> Net interest income	     14,794  13,956  43,260  41,047</p>
<p>Provision for possible</p>
<p>  loan losses			 1,190     956   5,770   2,626</p>
<p> Net income			   2,834   4,380  11,189  12,539</p>
<p>  Earnings per share		 0.37    0.56    1.44    1.60</p>
<p>  Average shares outstanding    7,722   7,838   7,791   7,849</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 and nine months 1996 net includes $0.26/shr SAIF charge.</p>
<p>Company reported earnings late Tuesday after the market closed.</p>
</text>
